586 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Qutb Shahi Website project was designed to enhance the visitor experience by helping users explore and understand the Qutb Shahi Tombs more effectively\056 The platform aims to provide visitors with clear information about the site\220s history\054 architecture\054 and key attractions\054 making exploration more structured and engaging\056 Through intuitive navigation\054 organized content\054 and an immersive digital experience\054 the project was developed to support both first\055time visitors and tourists in planning\054 understanding\054 and experiencing the heritage site with greater ease and context\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 587 0 R
     /Pg 574 0 R
